* OTA-law log → syllabic LPF → antilog envelope
*
* Pins: IN ENV VCC VEE
*   IN   — band-limited audio (any polarity)
*   ENV  — non-negative envelope, roughly tracks |IN| after τ
*
* Law matches HALF13700's Vt: Vlog = Vt·ln(1+|x|/Vref), then exp restore.
* Param TAU: envelope time constant (default 10 ms).

.subckt logenv IN ENV VCC VEE params: TAU=10m VREF=0.05

* Full-wave magnitude (precision abs stand-in; keeps the deck convergent)
Babs ABS 0 V = abs(V(IN))
Rabs ABS 0 100k

* Log (OTA-law Vt = 26 mV)
Blog LRAW 0 V = 0.026 * log(1 + V(ABS) / VREF)
Rlraw LRAW 0 100k

* Syllabic LPF: τ = R·C
Rlp LRAW LPF 100k
Clp LPF 0 {TAU / 100k}
Rbleed LPF 0 10Meg

* Antilog → ENV ≥ 0
Bexp ENV 0 V = VREF * (exp(V(LPF) / 0.026) - 1)
Renv ENV 0 100k

.ends logenv
